  NamikazeOS 3.0.0-alpha.4 - the airootfs live system

  You are in the persistent layer demo environment. The root
  filesystem is the live airootfs; everything you keep goes into a
  NamFS encrypted volume (AES-256-XTS, PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256).

  Quick start:
    namikaze-doctor          system health check
    namikaze-fstool          create / inspect encrypted volumes
    namikaze-persist         persistence policy and LUKS2 volumes
